`internal/process/process_command.go` was patched with the opt-in
`LLAMA_SWAP_LIFECYCLE_PROFILE_PATH` JSONL state-transition profiler described in
this artifact. The patch added no routing or process-lifecycle behavior: it only
records monotonic durations for `stopped -> starting -> ready` and
`ready -> stopping -> stopped`. The benchmark binary was built from llama-swap
commit `c6adf57df1ac2e3dff2402dbb479cd5a133b6afe` plus that instrumentation.

The exact source diff remains in the llama-swap repository working tree until
this benchmark is finalized; it was validated with:

    go test ./internal/process ./internal/router ./internal/server
